; What the offline tools are asked, each request the inline Datom object its
; tool takes: lojix-inspect-store a store path, and lojix-bootstrap a whole
; run, its input, builder, optional hermetic test, boot-once backend and
; output paths. The bootstrap reads the request as it arrived; nothing
; restates it.
